# app: widgets6
# Clipboard sync with the paired phone (DECISIONS.md D23, COMPANION.md 7 `clip`): the phone shared "Pick up bread / and milk"
# (fixture ha-clip.example.test). A long press reads the relay first, so the sheet offers the phone's text; Paste puts it in the
# three-line field. Copy all on the Paper pushes a `clip` to the relay (fixture answers 200; no visible change).
